 ## 6. Limitations and notes
 
 - **llvmpipe only.** Every frame and number here is software rendering on a shared 4-CPU machine. Load from other
-  sessions moved between 2.9 and 9.1 during the stage; the costs of §4 were taken in an after/before/before/after order
+  sessions moved between 1.3 and 9.1 during the stage; the costs of §4 were taken in an after/before/before/after order
